flowchart TD
    Start([Start synchronisation]) --> Check{Do we have a previous ETag?}

    Check -- No, first import --> Full[OpenRift returns the full list of cards]
    Check -- Yes --> Request[Query to OpenRift with ETag]

    Request --> Changed{Has the list changed?}
    Changed -- No --> Unchanged[No data retrieval]
    Unchanged --> History[Record synchronisation history]

    Changed -- Yes --> Full
    Full --> Store[Save directory and new ETag]
    Store --> Done([Synchronisation complete])
    History --> Done